{"html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Explore the Pagoda</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#182f32;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}#root{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#d6b899}canvas{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none;cursor:grab;outline:none}canvas:active{cursor:grabbing}#hud{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;color:#fff7dd}#intro{position:absolute;left:5%;top:7%;text-shadow:0 3px 24px #193b3b80}#intro p{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:clamp(14px,1.35vw,26px);letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase}h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(36px,4.7vw,90px);font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:1.05}#intro .sub{margin-top:20px;font-size:clamp(15px,1.45vw,28px);letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;max-width:600px}#controls{position:absolute;left:4%;right:4%;bottom:4%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;font-size:clamp(12px,1.25vw,24px)}.panel{pointer-events:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:13px 17px;background:#142f30e8;border:1px solid #e8c98b40;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #0b252530;backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}.hint{line-height:1.5;padding:0 8px}.hint strong{font-weight:550;color:#f5d790}.hint span{white-space:nowrap}button{font:inherit;color:#fff3d3;border:1px solid #e7ca8c55;background:#ffffff08;border-radius:10px;min-width:46px;min-height:46px;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer}button:hover,button:focus-visible{background:#fff0c325;outline:2px solid #ecd292;outline-offset:2px}button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#e6c78b;color:#233c37;border-color:#e6c78b}.label{font-size:.8em;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 5px}.movement{gap:7px}.movement button{padding:7px;min-width:40px}#tour{margin-left:8px;white-space:nowrap}@media(max-width:1000px){#controls{gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;bottom:3%}.panel{padding:8px 10px;gap:6px;border-radius:12px}button{min-width:32px;min-height:34px;padding:5px 8px}.movement button{min-width:32px}.hint{padding:0}.label{margin:0 3px}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"main\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-duration=\"24\">\n<canvas id=\"scene\" class=\"clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"24\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Interactive three-dimensional pagoda. Use W A S D or arrow keys to move, drag to look, Q and E to change height, and number keys one through five to visit floors.\"></canvas>\n<div id=\"hud\" class=\"clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"24\">\n<div id=\"intro\"><p>A garden in the evening light</p><h1>Enter the pagoda.</h1><p class=\"sub\">Five floors. Open balconies. A different view at every height.</p></div>\n<div id=\"controls\">\n<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"hint\"><span><strong>WASD</strong> move &nbsp; · &nbsp; <strong>drag</strong> to look</span><br><span><strong>Q / E</strong> lower / rise &nbsp; · &nbsp; <strong>1–5</strong> visit a floor</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"panel movement\" aria-label=\"Movement controls\"><button data-move=\"w\" aria-label=\"Move forward\">↑</button><button data-move=\"a\" aria-label=\"Move left\">←</button><button data-move=\"s\" aria-label=\"Move backward\">↓</button><button data-move=\"d\" aria-label=\"Move right\">→</button></div>\n<div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"label\">Floors</span><button data-floor=\"0\" aria-label=\"Visit floor one\" aria-pressed=\"false\">1</button><button data-floor=\"1\" aria-label=\"Visit floor two\" aria-pressed=\"false\">2</button><button data-floor=\"2\" aria-label=\"Visit floor three\" aria-pressed=\"false\">3</button><button data-floor=\"3\" aria-label=\"Visit floor four\" aria-pressed=\"false\">4</button><button data-floor=\"4\" aria-label=\"Visit floor five\" aria-pressed=\"false\">5</button><button id=\"tour\">Tour view</button></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"gsap.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\n'use strict';\n// Editable scene settings. All geometry is generated below, with no remote assets.\nconst SETTINGS={width:1920,height:1080,duration:24,floors:5,floorHeight:4.4,baseHalfWidth:8.6,taper:1.1};\nconst W=SETTINGS.width,H=SETTINGS.height,TAU=Math.PI*2;\nconst canvas=document.getElementById('scene'),ctx=canvas.getContext('2d',{alpha:false});\nconst intro=document.getElementById('intro');\nconst faces=[],columns=[];\nconst colors={red:'#963f31',redLight:'#bc5540',wood:'#713e2d',gold:'#cba35d',roof:'#286b62',roofDark:'#164b49',stone:'#c6bba0',floor:'#b97848'};\nconst V=(x,y,z)=>({x,y,z});\nconst clamp=(n,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,n));\nconst lerp=(a,b,t)=>a+(b-a)*t;\nconst smooth=t=>{t=clamp(t,0,1);return t*t*(3-2*t)};\nfunction shade(hex,n){const v=parseInt(hex.slice(1),16);return 'rgb('+Math.round(((v>>16)&255)*n)+','+Math.round(((v>>8)&255)*n)+','+Math.round((v&255)*n)+')'}\nfunction face(vertices,color,lit=true,outline=null){\n let c=color;\n if(lit){const a=vertices[0],b=vertices[1],d=vertices[2],ux=b.x-a.x,uy=b.y-a.y,uz=b.z-a.z,vx=d.x-a.x,vy=d.y-a.y,vz=d.z-a.z;let nx=uy*vz-uz*vy,ny=uz*vx-ux*vz,nz=ux*vy-uy*vx;const l=Math.hypot(nx,ny,nz)||1;nx/=l;ny/=l;nz/=l;const light=.69+.31*Math.max(0,-.42*nx+.78*ny+.46*nz);c=shade(color,light)}\n faces.push({v:vertices,c,outline});\n}\nfunction box(x,y,z,sx,sy,sz,color){\n const a=x-sx/2,b=x+sx/2,c=y-sy/2,d=y+sy/2,e=z-sz/2,f=z+sz/2;\n const p=[V(a,c,e),V(b,c,e),V(b,c,f),V(a,c,f),V(a,d,e),V(b,d,e),V(b,d,f),V(a,d,f)];\n [[0,1,2,3],[4,7,6,5],[3,2,6,7],[0,4,5,1],[0,3,7,4],[1,5,6,2]].forEach(q=>face(q.map(i=>p[i]),color));\n}\nfunction cylinder(x,y,z,r,h,color,n=10,topRadius=r){\n let lower=[],upper=[];\n for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let a=i*TAU/n;lower.push(V(x+Math.cos(a)*r,y,z+Math.sin(a)*r));upper.push(V(x+Math.cos(a)*topRadius,y+h,z+Math.sin(a)*topRadius))}\n for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let j=(i+1)%n;face([lower[i],upper[i],upper[j],lower[j]],color)}\n face(upper.slice().reverse(),color);face(lower,color);\n}\nfunction disc(x,y,z,r,color,n=48){let p=[];for(let i=n-1;i>=0;i--){let a=i*TAU/n;p.push(V(x+Math.cos(a)*r,y,z+Math.sin(a)*r))}face(p,color,false)}\nfunction beam(a,b,width,color){\n // A rectangular horizontal or diagonal architectural strut.\n const dx=b.x-a.x,dy=b.y-a.y,dz=b.z-a.z,len=Math.hypot(dx,dy,dz)||1;\n const side=Math.hypot(dx,dz)||1,px=-dz/side*width/2,pz=dx/side*width/2;\n const q=[V(a.x+px,a.y-width/2,a.z+pz),V(a.x-px,a.y-width/2,a.z-pz),V(a.x-px,a.y+width/2,a.z-pz),V(a.x+px,a.y+width/2,a.z+pz),V(b.x+px,b.y-width/2,b.z+pz),V(b.x-px,b.y-width/2,b.z-pz),V(b.x-px,b.y+width/2,b.z-pz),V(b.x+px,b.y+width/2,b.z+pz)];\n [[0,4,5,1],[3,2,6,7],[0,3,7,4],[1,5,6,2],[0,1,2,3],[4,7,6,5]].forEach(f=>face(f.map(i=>q[i]),color));\n}\nfunction lantern(x,y,z,scale=1){\n const rings=[[-.64,.18],[-.50,.40],[-.25,.51],[.22,.51],[.49,.37],[.60,.18]],n=10;\n for(let j=0;j<rings.length-1;j++)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){\n const a=i*TAU/n,b=(i+1)*TAU/n,A=rings[j],B=rings[j+1];\n face([V(x+Math.cos(a)*A[1]*scale,y+A[0]*scale,z+Math.sin(a)*A[1]*scale),V(x+Math.cos(a)*B[1]*scale,y+B[0]*scale,z+Math.sin(a)*B[1]*scale),V(x+Math.cos(b)*B[1]*scale,y+B[0]*scale,z+Math.sin(b)*B[1]*scale),V(x+Math.cos(b)*A[1]*scale,y+A[0]*scale,z+Math.sin(b)*A[1]*scale)],i%2? '#b84932':'#df7951');\n }\n cylinder(x,y-.69*scale,z,.2*scale,.11*scale,colors.gold,10);cylinder(x,y+.57*scale,z,.2*scale,.11*scale,colors.gold,10);\n box(x,y+.88*scale,z,.035*scale,.5*scale,.035*scale,colors.gold);\n cylinder(x,y-1.05*scale,z,.055*scale,.38*scale,colors.gold,6);\n}\nfunction roof(floor,h,index){\n const inner=index===4?.28:h-1.5,outer=h+1.55;\n const radii=[inner,lerp(inner,outer,.32),lerp(inner,outer,.65),lerp(inner,outer,.88),outer];\n const heights=index===4?[floor+5.25,floor+4.21,floor+3.58,floor+3.49,floor+3.84]:[floor+4.48,floor+3.89,floor+3.45,floor+3.38,floor+3.76];\n const seg=14;\n function p(side,s,r,y){let u=lerp(-r,r,s);if(side===0)return V(u,y,r);if(side===1)return V(r,y,-u);if(side===2)return V(-u,y,-r);return V(-r,y,u)}\n for(let side=0;side<4;side++){\n for(let j=0;j<4;j++)for(let k=0;k<seg;k++){\n let a=p(side,k/seg,radii[j],heights[j]),b=p(side,(k+1)/seg,radii[j],heights[j]),c=p(side,(k+1)/seg,radii[j+1],heights[j+1]),d=p(side,k/seg,radii[j+1],heights[j+1]);\n face([a,b,c,d],k%2?'#2b7067':'#236157',true,'#173f3d');\n if(j===3){face([V(d.x,d.y-.17,d.z),V(c.x,c.y-.17,c.z),c,d],colors.gold)}\n }\n beam(p(side,0,outer,heights[4]-.1),p(side,1,outer,heights[4]-.1),.13,colors.gold);\n }\n for(let sx of [-1,1])for(let sz of [-1,1]){\n let points=[V(sx*inner,heights[0]+.08,sz*inner),V(sx*radii[2],heights[2]+.08,sz*radii[2]),V(sx*outer,heights[4]+.11,sz*outer),V(sx*(outer+.31),heights[4]+.58,sz*(outer+.31))];\n for(let i=0;i<points.length-1;i++)beam(points[i],points[i+1],.17,colors.gold);\n }\n if(index===4){cylinder(0,floor+5.15,0,.38,.35,colors.gold,12,.24);cylinder(0,floor+5.5,0,.2,1.3,colors.gold,10,.035);cylinder(0,floor+5.78,0,.38,.16,colors.gold,12,.25)}\n}\nfunction rail(x1,z1,x2,z2,y,opening){\n let segments=8;\n for(let i=0;i<segments;i++){\n let a=i/segments,b=(i+1)/segments;\n if(opening&&a>=.375&&b<=.625)continue;\n let x=lerp(x1,x2,a),z=lerp(z1,z2,a),xx=lerp(x1,x2,b),zz=lerp(z1,z2,b);\n box(x,y+.56,z,.12,1.12,.12,colors.red);\n beam(V(x,y+1.08,z),V(xx,y+1.08,zz),.14,colors.redLight);\n beam(V(x,y+.30,z),V(xx,y+.30,zz),.08,colors.gold);\n const mx=(x+xx)/2,mz=(z+zz)/2;box(mx,y+.66,mz,.07,.65,.07,colors.gold);\n }\n box(x2,y+.56,z2,.13,1.12,.13,colors.red);\n}\n// Water, island, garden, and a broad approach aligned to the entrance.\nbox(0,-1.05,0,500,.4,500,'#567d79');\nbox(0,-.53,0,68,.7,61,'#66705a');\nbox(0,-.14,0,27,.25,27,colors.stone);\nbox(0,-.07,25,5.7,.18,28,'#b7ac91');\nfor(let z=13;z<40;z+=2.2){box(0,.035,z,5.3,.05,.07,'#928b75');box((Math.round(z)%2?-.7:.7),.04,z+1,.06,.05,2,'#9f957f')}\n// Stepped stone platform and entrance stairs.\nbox(0,.13,0,20.5,.45,20.5,'#8d9686');\nbox(0,.40,0,19.7,.22,19.7,colors.stone);\nfor(let i=0;i<4;i++)box(0,.03+i*.105,11.7-i*.46,4.3,.17,.55,colors.stone);\nfor(let i=0;i<5;i++){\n const y=.6+i*SETTINGS.floorHeight,h=SETTINGS.baseHalfWidth-i*SETTINGS.taper;\n box(0,y-.14,0,(h+.55)*2,.28,(h+.55)*2,colors.wood);\n // The floor is four editable panels, leaving a square stairwell.\n const hole=1.65;\n box(0,y+.025,(h+hole)/2,h*2,.07,h-hole,colors.floor);\n box(0,y+.025,-(h+hole)/2,h*2,.07,h-hole,colors.floor);\n box((h+hole)/2,y+.025,0,h-hole,.07,hole*2,colors.floor);\n box(-(h+hole)/2,y+.025,0,h-hole,.07,hole*2,colors.floor);\n for(let n=-Math.floor(h);n<=Math.floor(h);n++){\n if(Math.abs(n)>hole)box(n,y+.068,0,.025,.012,h*2,'#9f643d');\n else{box(n,y+.068,(h+hole)/2,.025,.012,h-hole,'#9f643d');box(n,y+.068,-(h+hole)/2,.025,.012,h-hole,'#9f643d')}\n }\n const p=h-.7;\n const positions=[[-p,-p],[0,-p],[p,-p],[-p,0],[p,0],[-p,p],[p,p]];\n positions.forEach(([x,z])=>{\n cylinder(x,y+.07,z,.36,.17,'#b4aa8e',10);\n cylinder(x,y+.24,z,.205,2.98,colors.redLight,10);\n cylinder(x,y+3.04,z,.30,.18,colors.gold,8);\n columns.push({x,z,bottom:y,top:y+3.4,r:.36});\n for(let sign of [-1,1]){\n beam(V(x,y+2.55,z),V(x+sign*.72,y+3.25,z),.12,colors.red);\n beam(V(x,y+2.55,z),V(x,y+3.25,z+sign*.72),.12,colors.red);\n }\n });\n for(let s of [-1,1]){\n box(0,y+3.21,s*p,p*2+.6,.25,.32,colors.red);\n box(s*p,y+3.21,0,.32,.25,p*2+.6,colors.red);\n box(0,y+3.40,s*p,p*2+.9,.09,.40,colors.gold);\n box(s*p,y+3.40,0,.40,.09,p*2+.9,colors.gold);\n }\n for(let n=-2;n<=2;n++){\n if(n===0)continue;\n box(n*h*.27,y+3.05,0,.12,.15,p*2,colors.wood);\n }\n rail(-h,-h,h,-h,y,false);rail(h,-h,h,h,y,false);rail(h,h,-h,h,y,i===0);rail(-h,h,-h,-h,y,false);\n lantern(-p*.68,y+2.35,p,.62);lantern(p*.68,y+2.35,p,.62);\n lantern(p,y+2.35,-p*.65,.50);lantern(-p,y+2.35,-p*.65,.50);\n // A small geometric inlay beneath the front opening.\n disc(0,y+.075,h*.55,1.08,'#cda467',32);disc(0,y+.079,h*.55,.88,'#925b36',32);\n for(let n=0;n<8;n++){let a=n*TAU/8;beam(V(Math.cos(a)*.3,y+.09,h*.55+Math.sin(a)*.3),V(Math.cos(a)*.8,y+.09,h*.55+Math.sin(a)*.8),.045,colors.gold)}\n roof(y,h,i);\n}\n// Central spiral staircase: visible treads connect every storey.\ncylinder(0,.6,0,.23,18.8,colors.red,12);\nfor(let i=0;i<88;i++){\n const a=i*TAU/22,y=.67+i*.20,r0=.27,r1=1.46,da=TAU/22*.88;\n const p=[V(Math.cos(a)*r0,y,Math.sin(a)*r0),V(Math.cos(a+da)*r0,y,Math.sin(a+da)*r0),V(Math.cos(a+da)*r1,y,Math.sin(a+da)*r1),V(Math.cos(a)*r1,y,Math.sin(a)*r1)];\n face(p.slice().reverse(),'#d59a59');face([p[3],p[2],V(p[2].x,y-.12,p[2].z),V(p[3].x,y-.12,p[3].z)],colors.wood);\n if(i%2===0){const x=Math.cos(a)*r1,z=Math.sin(a)*r1;box(x,y+.43,z,.045,.86,.045,colors.gold);beam(V(x,y+.87,z),V(Math.cos(a+TAU/11)*r1,y+1.27,Math.sin(a+TAU/11)*r1),.065,colors.red)}\n}\nfunction pine(x,z,height,phase){\n cylinder(x,-.2,z,.24,height*.7,'#684c38',7,.13);\n for(let j=0;j<4;j++){let y=height*(.23+j*.15),r=height*(.30-j*.048);cylinder(x+Math.sin(phase+j)*.2,y,z+Math.cos(phase+j)*.15,r,height*.34,j%2?'#305b49':'#3d6850',9,.03)}\n}\n[[-24,7,9],[-21,-15,12],[23,-11,11],[26,11,8],[-25,23,7],[17,-24,8],[-9,-24,10],[27,-24,12]].forEach((p,i)=>pine(p[0],p[1],p[2],i));\n// Low shrubs and stepping stones use a fixed trigonometric arrangement.\nfor(let i=0;i<26;i++){\n const a=i*2.39996,r=17+(i%4)*3,x=Math.cos(a)*r,z=Math.sin(a)*r;\n if(z>10&&Math.abs(x)<5)continue;\n cylinder(x,-.15,z,.9+(i%3)*.25,.65,'#6b7657',7,.4);\n}\nfor(let side of [-1,1]){\n disc(side*20,-.12,6,5.4,'#94a799',40);disc(side*20,-.105,6,4.95,'#517875',40);\n for(let j=0;j<7;j++){let a=j*2.3;disc(side*20+Math.cos(a)*3.4,-.09,6+Math.sin(a)*3,.4,'#81926a',10)}\n for(let j=0;j<3;j++){let x=side*(13+j*3.4),z=18+j*1.8;cylinder(x,-.05,z,.6,.5,'#9b9d88',6,.5)}\n}\n// Camera and deterministic frame renderer.\nfunction look(eye,target){const dx=target.x-eye.x,dy=target.y-eye.y,dz=target.z-eye.z;return {x:eye.x,y:eye.y,z:eye.z,yaw:Math.atan2(dx,dz),pitch:Math.atan2(dy,Math.hypot(dx,dz))}}\nconst shots=[\n {t:0,e:V(36,24,45),q:V(0,10.3,0)},\n {t:5,e:V(22,19,38),q:V(0,10.4,0)},\n {t:9,e:V(6,7,27),q:V(0,6,0)},\n {t:13,e:V(.4,2.6,14),q:V(0,2.25,0)},\n {t:17,e:V(.4,2.55,6.2),q:V(-1,2.7,-1)},\n {t:21,e:V(4.5,2.55,3.8),q:V(0,3,-.3)},\n {t:24,e:V(5.5,2.7,-1.5),q:V(0,4,0)}\n];\nfunction tourCamera(t){\n let j=0;while(j<shots.length-2&&t>shots[j+1].t)j++;\n const a=shots[j],b=shots[j+1],u=smooth((t-a.t)/(b.t-a.t));\n return look(V(lerp(a.e.x,b.e.x,u),lerp(a.e.y,b.e.y,u),lerp(a.e.z,b.e.z,u)),V(lerp(a.q.x,b.q.x,u),lerp(a.q.y,b.q.y,u),lerp(a.q.z,b.q.z,u)));\n}\nconst time={t:0};let navigation=null;\nfunction basis(c){const sy=Math.sin(c.yaw),cy=Math.cos(c.yaw),sp=Math.sin(c.pitch),cp=Math.cos(c.pitch);return {r:V(cy,0,-sy),u:V(-sy*sp,cp,-cy*sp),f:V(sy*cp,sp,cy*cp)}}\nfunction toCamera(p,c,b){const x=p.x-c.x,y=p.y-c.y,z=p.z-c.z;return {x:x*b.r.x+y*b.r.y+z*b.r.z,y:x*b.u.x+y*b.u.y+z*b.u.z,z:x*b.f.x+y*b.f.y+z*b.f.z}}\nfunction clipNear(vertices){\n const out=[],near=.16;\n for(let i=0;i<vertices.length;i++){\n const a=vertices[i],b=vertices[(i+1)%vertices.length],ina=a.z>=near,inb=b.z>=near;\n if(ina)out.push(a);\n if(ina!==inb){const u=(near-a.z)/(b.z-a.z);out.push({x:lerp(a.x,b.x,u),y:lerp(a.y,b.y,u),z:near})}\n }\n return out;\n}\nfunction background(c,t){\n const horizon=H*.49+Math.tan(c.pitch)*H*.96;\n const sky=ctx.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,H);sky.addColorStop(0,'#6f9998');sky.addColorStop(.46,'#d6c4a2');sky.addColorStop(1,'#f3d3a0');ctx.fillStyle=sky;ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);\n const sunX=W*.75+Math.sin(c.yaw)*120,sunY=clamp(horizon-H*.28,-120,H*.48);\n const glow=ctx.createRadialGradient(sunX,sunY,10,sunX,sunY,230);glow.addColorStop(0,'#fff1bc90');glow.addColorStop(1,'#fff1bc00');ctx.fillStyle=glow;ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);ctx.fillStyle='#ffe9b0';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(sunX,sunY,49,0,TAU);ctx.fill();\n for(let layer=0;layer<3;layer++){\n ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(0,H);\n for(let x=0;x<=W+20;x+=20){let u=x/W*8+c.yaw*.4;const ridge=Math.sin(u*1.4+layer)*40+Math.sin(u*3.1+layer*.8)*25+Math.sin(u*.6+2)*50;ctx.lineTo(x,horizon-40-layer*8+ridge*(1-layer*.18))}\n ctx.lineTo(W,H);ctx.closePath();ctx.fillStyle=['#84978b','#7f9484','#758b77'][layer];ctx.fill();\n }\n}\nfunction render(t){\n const c=navigation||tourCamera(t),b=basis(c),focal=H*.96;\n background(c,t);\n const queue=[];\n for(const face of faces){\n const raw=face.v.map(p=>toCamera(p,c,b));\n if(raw.every(p=>p.z<.16))continue;\n const points=clipNear(raw);if(points.length<3)continue;\n let minX=Infinity,minY=Infinity,maxX=-Infinity,maxY=-Infinity,depth=0;\n const screen=points.map(p=>{const x=W*.5+p.x*focal/p.z,y=H*.49-p.y*focal/p.z;minX=Math.min(minX,x);maxX=Math.max(maxX,x);minY=Math.min(minY,y);maxY=Math.max(maxY,y);depth+=p.z;return {x,y}});\n if(maxX<0||minX>W||maxY<0||minY>H)continue;\n queue.push({p:screen,z:depth/points.length,c:face.c,o:face.outline});\n }\n queue.sort((a,b)=>b.z-a.z);\n ctx.lineJoin='round';\n for(const item of queue){\n ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(item.p[0].x,item.p[0].y);for(let i=1;i<item.p.length;i++)ctx.lineTo(item.p[i].x,item.p[i].y);ctx.closePath();ctx.fillStyle=item.c;ctx.fill();\n if(item.o&&item.z<100){ctx.strokeStyle=item.o;ctx.lineWidth=clamp(22/item.z,.35,1.7);ctx.stroke()}\n }\n // A gentle lens vignette is painted anew every frame.\n const vignette=ctx.createRadialGradient(W*.5,H*.46,H*.23,W*.5,H*.5,W*.67);vignette.addColorStop(0,'#102e2e00');vignette.addColorStop(1,'#102e2e4a');ctx.fillStyle=vignette;ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);\n intro.style.opacity=navigation?'0':String(1-smooth((t-3.8)/2.2));\n}\nfunction beginNavigation(){if(!navigation)navigation={...tourCamera(time.t)};intro.style.opacity='0';return navigation}\nfunction markFloor(n){document.querySelectorAll('[data-floor]').forEach(el=>el.setAttribute('aria-pressed',Number(el.dataset.floor)===n?'true':'false'))}\nfunction visitFloor(n){\n const h=SETTINGS.baseHalfWidth-n*SETTINGS.taper,y=.6+n*SETTINGS.floorHeight;\n navigation=look(V(2.5,y+1.85,h*.68),V(0,y+2,-.7));markFloor(n);render(time.t);\n}\nfunction move(key,fast=false){\n const c=beginNavigation(),step=fast?1.15:.54,s=Math.sin(c.yaw),co=Math.cos(c.yaw);let dx=0,dz=0,dy=0;\n if(key==='w'||key==='arrowup'){dx=s*step;dz=co*step}\n if(key==='s'||key==='arrowdown'){dx=-s*step;dz=-co*step}\n if(key==='d'){dx=co*step;dz=-s*step}\n if(key==='a'){dx=-co*step;dz=s*step}\n if(key==='q')dy=-step;if(key==='e')dy=step;\n if(key==='arrowleft')c.yaw-=.085;if(key==='arrowright')c.yaw+=.085;\n let nx=c.x+dx,nz=c.z+dz;\n // Keep the viewer outside structural columns; the camera can rise freely.\n for(const p of columns)if(c.y>p.bottom&&c.y<p.top+.4){let x=nx-p.x,z=nz-p.z,d=Math.hypot(x,z),r=p.r+.25;if(d<r){if(d<.001){x=1;z=0;d=1}nx=p.x+x/d*r;nz=p.z+z/d*r}}\n c.x=clamp(nx,-65,65);c.z=clamp(nz,-65,65);c.y=clamp(c.y+dy,.95,34);markFloor(-1);render(time.t);\n}\ncanvas.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{\n const k=e.key.toLowerCase();\n if('12345'.includes(k)&&k.length===1){e.preventDefault();visitFloor(Number(k)-1);return}\n if(['w','a','s','d','q','e','arrowup','arrowdown','arrowleft','arrowright'].includes(k)){e.preventDefault();move(k,e.shiftKey)}\n if(k==='r'){navigation=null;markFloor(-1);render(time.t)}\n});\nlet drag=null;\ncanvas.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{canvas.focus({preventScroll:true});const c=beginNavigation();drag={id:e.pointerId,x:e.clientX,y:e.clientY,yaw:c.yaw,pitch:c.pitch};canvas.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);render(time.t)});\ncanvas.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(!drag||drag.id!==e.pointerId)return;const rect=canvas.getBoundingClientRect();navigation.yaw=drag.yaw-(e.clientX-drag.x)/rect.width*3.3;navigation.pitch=clamp(drag.pitch+(e.clientY-drag.y)/rect.height*2.2,-1.24,1.24);render(time.t)});\nfunction endDrag(e){if(drag&&drag.id===e.pointerId)drag=null}\ncanvas.addEventListener('pointerup',endDrag);canvas.addEventListener('pointercancel',endDrag);canvas.addEventListener('lostpointercapture',()=>{drag=null});\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-floor]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{visitFloor(Number(button.dataset.floor));canvas.focus({preventScroll:true})}));\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-move]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{move(button.dataset.move);canvas.focus({preventScroll:true})}));\ndocument.getElementById('tour').addEventListener('click',()=>{navigation=null;markFloor(-1);render(time.t);canvas.focus({preventScroll:true})});\n// One paused, seek-safe timeline owns the entire guided camera animation.\nconst timeline=gsap.timeline({paused:true});\ntimeline.to(time,{t:SETTINGS.duration,duration:SETTINGS.duration,ease:'none',onUpdate:()=>render(time.t)},0);\nwindow.__timelines=window.__timelines||{};\nwindow.__timelines['main']=timeline;\nrender(0);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","width":1920,"height":1080,"duration_seconds":24,"assumptions":["Chosen format: 1920×1080 with a 24-second guided approach and interior camera tour.","The five-storey pagoda and garden are fictional, stylized architectural designs, not a reconstruction of a specific building.","Interactive navigation uses WASD, mouse or touch dragging, Q/E for camera height, and numbered floor destinations. It is a free-camera exploration rather than a physical walking simulation.","Artwork is generated entirely with Canvas and editable geometry. No external assets, product facts, named fonts, or asset licenses are required. The harness supplies gsap.min.js.","User interaction overrides the guided camera until Tour view is selected. Without interaction, animation is determined by the single paused GSAP timeline.","The HTML has not been rendered or visually reviewed."],"missing_inputs":[],"summary":"Standalone 3D pagoda with five explorable floors, curved roofs, lanterns, balconies, a spiral staircase, garden scenery, and interactive camera controls."}